<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1540_5571.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> willig dienst zuvor,
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersame</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weise</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besonnders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guote</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freund</unclear>. Welcher massen
<lb n="4"/>wir unsers burgers <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mathej</unclear> Kaisers</persName>,
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewestes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gastgeben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zur</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guldin</unclear> Cron
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alhie</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glaeubigern</unclear> ein allge=
<lb n="7"/>meinen rechtstag <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">benennt</unclear> unnd
<lb n="8"/>angesetzt: Das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haben</unclear> E. E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. auß
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bei</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwahrtem</unclear> edict <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuvernemen</unclear>.
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Weil</unclear> dann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etliche</unclear> E. E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. burger deß=
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halben</unclear> auch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">interessirt</unclear> sein, unnd zu
<lb n="12"/>bemeltem <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Matheo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kaisern</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">forderung</unclear>
<lb n="13"/>unnd ansprach haben moechten: So bitten
<lb n="14"/>wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear>, E. E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. wellen sollich
<lb n="15"/>edict, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jrem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">habenden</unclear> gebrauch nach,
<lb n="16"/>bey <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jnen</unclear> an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gepürenden</unclear> orten offen=
<lb n="17"/>lich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anschlagen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">publicieren</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>lassen; damit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinen</unclear> rechten
<lb n="19"/>niemandts <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkürtzt</unclear>, noch der
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unwissenheit</unclear> sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubeklagen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ursach</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>habe. Das begeren umb E. E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1540_5572.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wißheit</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freunt</unclear>. unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachbarlich</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeuerdienen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Datum</unclear> <origDate when="1609-03-02" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">2</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">martij</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">a°</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1609</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="25"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-511" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear> und Rath
<lb n="26"/>der Statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Lindaw</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1540_5573.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1540_5574.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="27"/>Den Ersamen und weisen, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermeist</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">raht</unclear> der statt S. Gallen</orgName>, unsern besondern
<lb n="29"/>lieben unnd gueten freünden.
<lb n="30"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Santgallen</placeName>.
</p>
